  "body": "All buyers' agents welcome.\r\n\r\nDEADLINE SALE: offers close 4pm, Tuesday 8 December 2026 (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nTwo bedrooms, a renovated kitchen and bathroom, and a large timber deck, all in solid brick and tile. The renovation is done, so your weekends stay yours.\r\n\r\nWell suited to:\r\n*  First-home buyers wanting Half Moon Bay without a project\r\n*  Downsizers staying close to the marina, ferry and friends.\r\n*  Investors after low maintenance and a quality finish\r\n\r\nUpstairs\r\n*  Renovated kitchen with wall oven, cooktop, rangehood, dishwasher and waste disposal\r\n*  Open-plan dining and living with heat pump\r\n*  Two bedrooms; the second works well as a home office or guest room\r\n*  Bathroom with heated towel rail, plus a separate toilet\r\n\r\nDownstairs and outside\r\n*  Single garage with auto door, internal laundry and a separate storeroom\r\n*  Large timber deck, a private outdoor living area, with a landscaped garden\r\n\r\nLocation\r\nClose to Half Moon Bay Marina and ferry, local shops and parks. In zone for Wakaaranga School, Farm Cove Intermediate and Pakuranga College (buyers should confirm school zoning).\r\n\r\nHarcourts - Best In Real Estate Limited, Licensed REAA 2008",
